WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.851 --> 00:00:03.518
(pensive music)

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:06.870
- We are headed up to the
northern part of Israel

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:09.930
where residents around
these areas are very worried

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:13.049
about ongoing Hezbollah attacks.

00:00:13.049 --> 00:00:14.670
(siren ringing)

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:17.040
The people that we're meeting
around here are saying

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.340
that in the past week, there's
been more and more risk,

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:23.489
more and more people that
are leaving the city.

00:00:23.489 --> 00:00:27.989
(Avihay speaking in foreign language)

00:00:59.132 --> 00:01:02.490
(pensive music)

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:04.050
So right now, we're at Kibbutz Hagoshrim

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:05.040
where people have come

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:07.470
from all around the
community to prepare food

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:08.733
for the Israeli soldiers.

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:12.900
- It's important for them
to have like something,

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:15.090
even for once a day,

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:18.300
something good to eat
and to see other people

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:22.110
and to see the civilians
do all this stuff.

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:24.390
- The people here are
saying by cooking food

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:26.430
for the soldiers and
just trying to help out,

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:28.140
it's easing the tension of being so close

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.840
to the potential fighting
that's all around them.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:33.480
- Yesterday we had a alarm here

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:38.220
and we had all of us and
more people in this place.

00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:39.543
It's not very safe.

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:43.773
We get used to the bombs here, yeah.

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:46.110
There is no other option,

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:50.190
except for winning this war, I think.

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:51.630
And this is what we feel here.

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:56.630
So we do whatever we
can to raise the morale.

00:01:56.946 --> 00:01:58.020
(dramatic music)

00:01:58.020 --> 00:01:59.220
- So just now,

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:02.010
the mayor received an
evacuation order for the city.

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:03.630
That means all the residents here

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:05.250
are gonna be asked to leave.

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.340
They're gonna organize
buses to bring people out.

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:12.930
- The government decided
that all the citizens

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:14.310
who live five kilometer

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:17.073
from the border will
evacuate more souther.

00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:26.041
(Avihay speaking in foreign language)

00:02:32.901 --> 00:02:37.401
(Kiryat speaking in foreign language)

00:02:50.634 --> 00:02:52.380
(pensive music)

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.150
- [Ben] The border with
Lebanon is just right

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:57.570
across this mountain
here, and the worry is

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:01.890
as this war continues to drag
on and escalate that Hezbollah

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:04.800
in the north in Lebanon
could easily make a crossing

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:07.923
into this area the same way
that Hamas made a crossing.

00:03:08.823 --> 00:03:13.323
(Avihay speaking in foreign language)

00:03:34.953 --> 00:03:37.620
(pensive music)

